      "title": "Elementary abelian p-kernels have augmentation-ideal norm homology",
      "statement": "For a rank-k kernel in (C_p)^n over F_p, the norm is the top monomial and its square-zero homology is (I_B/Soc A_B) tensor A_(B^c), of dimension p^(n-k)(p^k-2) and Loewy length k(p-1)-1.",
